      <h1>About EnglishVidya</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; margin-top:-0.5rem;">
        Democratizing English Mastery with Mathematical Logic for Hindi-Medium Students
      </p>

      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>EnglishVidya</strong> — India's open educational English academy, founded by educator and systems architect <strong>Master Manikant Yadav</strong> in Supaul, Bihar. EnglishVidya was created to break the traditional barrier of rote memorization ("Ratta System") in English learning by introducing a structured, logic-first pedagogical framework.
      </p>

      <div class="quote-box">
        "English koi jaadui bhasha nahi hai, yeh ek structured mathematical system hai. Jab aap Hindi ki S+O+V structure ko English ki S+V+O equation me badalna samajh jaate hain, toh darr apne aap khatam ho jata hai."
        <footer>— Master Manikant Yadav, Founder of EnglishVidya</footer>
      </div>

      <h2>Our Core Mission & Philosophy</h2>
      <p>
        Most Hindi-medium students in Bihar and across North India face immense difficulty transitioning from school to higher education because traditional English teaching relies on memorizing rules without explaining the underlying grammar syntax equations. EnglishVidya solves this through:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>10-Level Grammar Master Ladder:</strong> A step-by-step ladder taking students from basic parts of speech to complex narration and voice transformation.</li>
        <li><strong>Bihar Board 10th & 12th Complete Syllabus:</strong> Line-by-line Hindi explanation of every prose and poetry chapter in Rainbow Part 2 and Panorama Part 2.</li>
        <li><strong>19,000+ Bilingual Audio Lexicon:</strong> A comprehensive dictionary with real-life Hindi meanings, native pronunciation TTS, and personal bookmarks.</li>
        <li><strong>100% Free & Open Access:</strong> Zero paywalls, zero locked PDF subscriptions, and open learning for everyone.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The Master Manikant Ecosystem</h2>
      <p>
        EnglishVidya is an integral part of the Master Manikant Educational Network alongside sister platforms like <a href="https://frankbase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FrankBase.com</a>, <a href="https://speed.frankbase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SpeedPulse</a>, <a href="https://typing.frankbase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Typing Tutor</a>, and <a href="https://frankpass.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FrankPass</a>.
      </p>

